WEBVTT

00:01.950 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:12.910 --> 00:15.620
How long until we reach the Pokémon Center?

00:16.660 --> 00:18.300
Quite a while, it seems...

00:18.680 --> 00:19.710
You heard that?

00:22.600 --> 00:24.640
I am starting to feel faint...

00:25.540 --> 00:27.630
Eureka doesn't mind at all!

00:31.440 --> 00:33.650
I want to be Dedenne or Squishy...

00:34.290 --> 00:35.180
You have a point...

00:35.700 --> 00:38.460
The sunlight is strong and the air is dry,

00:38.960 --> 00:39.850
so I can't blame you...

00:40.440 --> 00:43.870
There is no place around here where we could rest, is there?

00:44.130 --> 00:45.900
Hm... Doesn't look like it.

00:47.140 --> 00:49.000
It is over... I am going to collapse...

00:59.700 --> 01:00.560
A robot?

01:02.780 --> 01:04.610
What did you just say?!

01:08.230 --> 01:13.920
A Brigarron from the Wilderness!
The Tree-planting Robon!!

01:14.880 --> 01:19.960
As Satoshi and his friends continue their journey to Eisetsu Gym in order to obtain the eighth badge,

01:20.420 --> 01:25.190
they encounter a robot silently tilling the soil on desolate land.

01:25.990 --> 01:29.930
Hm... That robot has quite a retro feel to it!

01:29.930 --> 01:39.800
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

01:29.930 --> 01:39.800
Z

01:30.180 --> 01:31.620
It's just some old wreck.

01:31.940 --> 01:33.970
I wonder what it's doing in a place like this.

01:37.560 --> 01:38.900
Please get out of the way.

01:39.190 --> 01:40.460
It's talking!

01:40.750 --> 01:41.900
Yes, I can talk.

01:42.290 --> 01:43.980
It has an AI!

01:44.280 --> 01:46.640
I never would have expected that from its outer appearance.

01:56.320 --> 01:58.230
Is it... sowing seeds?

02:00.610 --> 02:02.000
What are you doing?!

02:02.720 --> 02:04.010
Growing them.

02:04.370 --> 02:05.600
"Growing"...?

02:07.430 --> 02:08.510
In a dry place like this?

02:09.620 --> 02:10.510
Will they grow?

02:10.700 --> 02:11.520
Not sure...

02:11.950 --> 02:14.320
Has this guy been working here non-stop?

02:14.320 --> 02:16.000
It is extremely seasoned.

02:16.540 --> 02:18.900
I wonder if someone is giving it commands.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.270
What's that?

02:23.440 --> 02:24.040
It's a Pokémon!

02:26.450 --> 02:26.990
That's a...

02:28.500 --> 02:32.310
Brigarron, the Spiny Armor Pokémon. The final evolved form of Harimaron.

02:32.750 --> 02:36.710
Its Tackle has enough force to flip a 50-ton tank.

02:37.100 --> 02:38.420
That's some ridiculous power!

02:38.420 --> 02:40.500
And it is charging toward us at full force!

02:49.700 --> 02:50.540
Awesome!

02:50.540 --> 02:52.340
This is not the time to be impressed!

02:52.640 --> 02:54.530
Let us just run away for now!

02:54.530 --> 02:55.040
Yeah!

02:59.420 --> 03:02.230
Just why is it attacking us?

03:02.230 --> 03:04.240
It almost looks like it's protecting the robot.

03:04.950 --> 03:06.400
Maybe they're friends.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.260
Not sure...

03:14.000 --> 03:14.770
What's this?

03:15.020 --> 03:17.250
Maybe it is connected to that robot somehow.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.240
There's no one in here.

03:19.600 --> 03:22.260
Is this some sort of laboratory?

03:26.270 --> 03:28.550
It really does seem like it is connected to it in some way.

03:29.120 --> 03:31.260
It looks like they used to grow plants.

03:32.020 --> 03:33.140
Ah, look!

03:35.010 --> 03:35.710
I wonder who that is.

03:38.120 --> 03:39.790
What are you guys doing?

03:43.190 --> 03:44.770
Oh, I'm Satoshi.

03:45.110 --> 03:46.350
This is my partner, Pikachu.

03:48.280 --> 03:49.350
I'm Serena.

03:49.580 --> 03:50.280
I'm Eureka.

03:50.560 --> 03:52.320
And these are Dedenne and Squishy.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.600
This is my big brother...

03:55.920 --> 03:56.770
I'm Citron.

03:58.770 --> 04:00.800
What business do you have at the Ichigaya Laboratory?

04:01.280 --> 04:04.190
Oh, I was curious about the robot outside.

04:04.750 --> 04:05.400
Uh-huh...

04:05.860 --> 04:06.800
Who are you?

04:07.270 --> 04:08.210
I'm Hiro.

04:08.840 --> 04:11.050
The man in the picture is my grandpa.

04:12.610 --> 04:15.560
If you wanna know about Robon, watch this.

04:16.630 --> 04:18.300
My name is Ichigaya.

04:18.870 --> 04:24.030
I am a scientist who researches environments in which Pokémon and people can live in happiness, see?

04:25.830 --> 04:32.470
This beautiful forest was blessed with abundant nature, and many wild Pokémon lived here.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.620
However, one day,

04:35.270 --> 04:37.590
the forest began withering, see?

04:38.560 --> 04:45.150
Just as I was about to look for the cause, I was struck with an incurable illness, see?

04:46.720 --> 04:52.030
I somehow managed to complete the development of Robon, a robot that will renaturate the forest,

04:52.400 --> 04:55.160
but I don't have much longer to live.

04:56.530 --> 05:01.630
The forest has already completely withered and both the Pokémon and the people have disappeared, see?

05:02.960 --> 05:06.630
Robon and Brigarron here are my last hope.

05:08.020 --> 05:12.690
If they are ever in trouble, I would want someone to help them out.

05:13.620 --> 05:17.780
That is my earnest wish, see?

05:20.480 --> 05:25.490
So Brigarron attacked us because it thought we had come to interfere with Robon...

05:26.100 --> 05:30.070
Even without grandpa around, Robon continues sowing seeds...

05:30.690 --> 05:33.920
...and Brigarron continues protecting Robon.

05:38.770 --> 05:39.200
Robon...

05:49.900 --> 05:52.060
It can even charge itself, huh?

05:52.060 --> 05:52.400
Yeah.

05:53.060 --> 05:55.470
But lately, it's taking an extremely long time.

05:56.550 --> 06:00.150
I'm sure it's starting to break from constantly overworking itself.

06:02.050 --> 06:02.790
Let me have a look.

06:08.660 --> 06:09.840
This can be fixed easily.

06:11.030 --> 06:13.020
My brother is an inventor.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.610
You can leave machinery stuff to him.

06:14.610 --> 06:15.480
Stop it!

06:16.300 --> 06:19.200
I want Robon and Brigarron to stop working!

06:19.960 --> 06:20.760
It's been so long...

06:21.500 --> 06:23.480
You've worked hard enough.

06:25.940 --> 06:29.190
Robon's goal is to revive the beautiful forest.

06:30.390 --> 06:34.990
And in that case, I think it is better to help them revive the forest instead of stopping them.

06:35.390 --> 06:38.200
But even all their hard work proved to be pointless!

06:38.740 --> 06:39.990
It's time to give up.

06:40.350 --> 06:43.330
Scientific progress comes to a stop the moment you give up.

06:44.160 --> 06:49.000
Not giving up and continuing to challenge new things is what makes science progress!

06:50.720 --> 06:51.540
He's right!

06:51.760 --> 06:53.140
I think so too!

06:53.140 --> 06:55.200
Yeah, you gotta keep challenging the unknown!

07:00.840 --> 07:01.440
Got it.

07:02.950 --> 07:04.430
I'll help too!

07:04.770 --> 07:05.280
Sure.

07:08.500 --> 07:10.120
Charging complete.

07:10.460 --> 07:12.270
Ah, it's charging faster now.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.290
Thank you, mister!

07:16.590 --> 07:18.260
Now that that's decided, let's do this!

07:22.010 --> 07:24.310
This place is <i>huge</i>, though...

07:27.710 --> 07:28.790
Wait, Brigarron!

07:29.710 --> 07:32.460
They all just want to help out Robon.

07:35.300 --> 07:37.010
Please believe us!

07:45.600 --> 07:46.920
Looks like it understood!

07:47.970 --> 07:49.230
Thank you, Brigarron!

07:49.860 --> 07:51.990
All right, let's revive the forest!

07:52.530 --> 07:53.880
Yeah!

07:54.700 --> 07:59.300
First off, we need to check if plants really can grow here.

07:59.540 --> 08:01.070
Huh? Can you figure that out?

08:01.330 --> 08:02.190
Heh heh heh...

08:02.530 --> 08:04.480
It is time for science to open up the future!

08:05.010 --> 08:06.320
Citronic Gear, on!

08:06.880 --> 08:10.550
I envisioned a situation like this and prepared a nice machine!

08:11.020 --> 08:13.840
I call it "Soil Analysis Simulation-kun"!

08:14.270 --> 08:15.550
Good job, bro!

08:17.560 --> 08:18.980
Let's switch it on right away.

08:20.320 --> 08:22.270
Beginning search...

08:25.710 --> 08:32.060
It is a groundbreaking machine that analyzes the components of the soil, simulates seeds being planted into it and visualizes the data.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.030
Nothing will grow on this soil.

08:42.480 --> 08:44.460
It seems the current situation will make it impossible.

08:44.860 --> 08:46.580
What do we do then?

08:47.080 --> 08:51.340
The fact that a forest used to exist on this land means that there must be a water vein somewhere.

08:52.070 --> 08:53.210
We will search for it!

08:57.000 --> 08:59.000
Then I choose you!

09:01.540 --> 09:03.400
Rentorar, you use your see-through skill.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.750
And Onbat, you use your Supersonic.

09:05.180 --> 09:07.060
Please search for an underground water vein.

09:07.300 --> 09:08.000
We're counting on you!

09:17.020 --> 09:19.940
You are sticking your vines into the ground to search for a water vein, right?

09:20.380 --> 09:22.080
Good idea, Harimaron.

09:26.400 --> 09:28.580
Barigarron, you are helping as well, huh?

09:36.520 --> 09:40.070
The brats have started doing something strange again...

09:40.270 --> 09:41.760
Not interested.

09:42.440 --> 09:46.580
More importantly, what do you think of getting that strong-looking Brigarron?

09:46.930 --> 09:49.720
That would increase our offensive capabilities and feel good!

10:27.180 --> 10:29.920
Nice work, Harimaron, Brigarron!

10:30.260 --> 10:31.500
Thank you, Onbat.

10:33.500 --> 10:34.930
You did it, Brigarron!

10:35.960 --> 10:37.550
Now it's your turn!

10:39.900 --> 10:40.740
Use Dig!

10:45.700 --> 10:46.790
All right, let's join in!

10:50.640 --> 10:51.060
Here.

10:51.390 --> 10:51.950
Here.

10:54.510 --> 10:55.430
What is the matter?

10:59.010 --> 10:59.830
What's this?

11:00.080 --> 11:02.210
Could we have hit a rock bed...?

11:03.590 --> 11:04.920
Let us check it.

11:06.150 --> 11:08.930
It is a huge rock, ten meters in diameter.

11:09.320 --> 11:12.940
The water vein is underneath; no water will come out unless we remove it.

11:18.710 --> 11:19.720
Pokémon Quiz.

11:20.080 --> 11:20.860
The answer is...?

11:26.680 --> 11:27.490
See?

11:29.910 --> 11:33.950
I believe that this rock might have sunk down due to crustal movement and covered the water vein as a result.

11:34.720 --> 11:36.960
The question is how to remove it.

11:50.980 --> 11:51.710
No use, huh?

11:51.920 --> 11:55.890
In order to make the rock brittle, I believe that temporarily heating it up, then quickly cooling it down,

11:56.480 --> 11:58.710
and finally attacking it all at once should be effective!

11:58.920 --> 11:59.630
Got it!

11:59.630 --> 12:00.190
All right!

12:03.760 --> 12:04.890
Tairenar, Flamethrower!

12:10.580 --> 12:12.100
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

12:15.870 --> 12:20.440
Harimaron, Pin Missile! Horubee, Mud Shot! Rentorar, Swift!

12:20.830 --> 12:22.320
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

12:22.560 --> 12:24.140
Nymphia, Swift!

12:36.290 --> 12:37.020
How's that?

12:38.540 --> 12:39.840
No way!

12:40.540 --> 12:42.420
Citron, isn't there any other way?

12:43.660 --> 12:45.820
If we cannot destroy it, our next plan will be...

12:48.080 --> 12:49.100
...to have everyone pull it!

12:49.550 --> 12:52.770
I call it the "If-Pushing-Does-Nothing-Then-We-Try-Pulling Plan!"

12:53.360 --> 12:55.190
That's not scientific at all...

12:55.550 --> 12:56.520
Let's go, everyone!

12:56.820 --> 12:57.340
Okay!

13:00.470 --> 13:01.550
On three!

13:01.900 --> 13:02.470
Yeah!

13:03.680 --> 13:04.880
One, two...

13:13.500 --> 13:14.470
What's going on?!

13:15.060 --> 13:17.250
If you say "What's going on?!",

13:17.480 --> 13:19.230
It is the world's mercy that makes us answer!

13:20.050 --> 13:21.720
To prevent the world's destruction!

13:22.510 --> 13:24.580
To protect the world's peace!

13:24.780 --> 13:27.350
Carrying out the evil of love and truth,

13:27.800 --> 13:30.000
we're lovely, charmy villains!

13:31.240 --> 13:31.830
Musashi!

13:32.300 --> 13:32.780
Kojiro!

13:33.650 --> 13:36.480
For the Rocket Gang duo dashing across the galaxy,

13:36.710 --> 13:39.380
a white hole, a white tomorrow awaits ahead!

13:39.570 --> 13:40.980
Just kidding!

13:44.280 --> 13:45.180
Rocket Gang!

13:45.180 --> 13:45.830
What do you think you're doing?

13:46.790 --> 13:47.550
Yay!

13:47.820 --> 13:51.490
We came here planning to take Pikachu and Brigarron-chan, but...

13:51.490 --> 13:53.520
...why not just take the whole bunch while we're at it?

13:53.520 --> 13:54.770
That's our plan.

13:58.160 --> 14:00.120
Please get out of the way.

14:00.120 --> 14:00.950
What's with this thing?

14:00.950 --> 14:02.710
There are seeds over there.

14:02.710 --> 14:04.310
Please step away.

14:04.840 --> 14:05.310
Seeds?

14:05.860 --> 14:06.480
Robon...

14:06.780 --> 14:08.510
Please step away.

14:08.510 --> 14:09.550
How annoying...

14:09.730 --> 14:09.980
Pumpjin!

14:13.260 --> 14:14.610
Shut this old clunker up.

14:15.650 --> 14:16.180
Please ste-!

14:21.020 --> 14:22.200
It's no use!

14:22.200 --> 14:25.870
Those are reinforced rings that won't come off no matter what!

14:31.340 --> 14:35.580
B...ri...gar...ro...n...

14:39.060 --> 14:39.670
All right.

14:40.020 --> 14:42.960
Brigarron, look at this. It's complete, see?

14:43.470 --> 14:46.000
Make sure to get along and help each other.

14:48.280 --> 14:51.460
You two are my hope, see?

14:52.400 --> 14:54.820
Pumpjin, subdue that thing for us, will you?

14:55.200 --> 14:56.130
You go too!

14:56.700 --> 14:58.030
Psybeam!

15:03.700 --> 15:07.820
B...ri...gar...ron,... his... ho... pe...

15:15.200 --> 15:15.970
Robon was...!

15:28.720 --> 15:29.660
No way!

15:43.110 --> 15:44.600
Now you've done it!

15:45.220 --> 15:46.870
What?!

15:47.220 --> 15:50.500
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken! Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

15:52.240 --> 15:53.590
Tairenar, Fire Blast!

15:55.010 --> 15:57.800
Harimaron, Pin Missile! Rentorar, Swift!

16:04.460 --> 16:06.470
This feels bad!

16:11.400 --> 16:11.960
Robon...

16:13.750 --> 16:15.350
Robon!

16:23.280 --> 16:25.460
Did Robon get destroyed?

16:25.980 --> 16:26.350
Yeah...

16:30.950 --> 16:33.440
Science comes to a standstill the moment we give up on it.

16:33.810 --> 16:36.440
But as long as we do not give up, nothing is impossible!

17:03.310 --> 17:04.510
Now it is back to normal!

17:04.780 --> 17:05.910
Whoa!

17:07.160 --> 17:08.630
Reactivating...

17:09.700 --> 17:11.800
Reactivated!

17:12.470 --> 17:13.380
Robon!

17:13.710 --> 17:15.600
This is so great! Isn't it great?

17:21.200 --> 17:23.910
Now then, what shall we do with that rock?

17:26.950 --> 17:28.790
Obstacle in place.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.980
Rock removal circuit operating...

17:39.040 --> 17:40.690
Removing rock...

17:46.280 --> 17:48.070
I did not know that Robon could do that!

17:53.260 --> 17:54.390
Awesome!

17:54.390 --> 17:55.540
We are counting on you, Robon!

17:55.980 --> 17:56.970
Go!

18:01.490 --> 18:03.360
Water has appeared!

18:05.040 --> 18:06.920
The water vein has been brought back to life!

18:06.920 --> 18:07.820
All right!

18:22.520 --> 18:24.020
Whoa, so pretty!

18:24.840 --> 18:26.740
It's water, Dedenne, Squishy!

18:31.600 --> 18:33.960
Let us have one more look at the simulation footage!

18:36.030 --> 18:37.680
Beginning search...

18:49.350 --> 18:51.950
Plants can grow on this soil.

18:52.470 --> 18:54.340
All right!

18:58.290 --> 19:00.240
Now grandpa's dream will be...

19:02.100 --> 19:04.240
There was something I learned while repairing Robon...

19:05.020 --> 19:07.520
There was love put into each and every part.

19:08.400 --> 19:13.150
One day, I too will become an inventor with high aspirations, just like Professor Ichigaya was!

19:16.590 --> 19:20.360
I'll walk the path of science, just like you, Citron-san!

19:21.630 --> 19:25.490
And when Robon gets broken, I'll repair it!

19:26.460 --> 19:28.900
Yes. I am sure you can do it, Hiro-kun.

19:30.230 --> 19:31.180
Please do your best.

19:32.190 --> 19:32.640
I will.

19:39.140 --> 19:41.820
Goodbye!

19:43.470 --> 19:44.590
Goodbye!

19:45.200 --> 19:46.520
Goodbye!

19:46.520 --> 19:48.720
Let's meet again someday.

19:50.820 --> 19:53.520
Thanks to everyone working together, the water vein has come back to life.

19:54.880 --> 20:00.790
Wishing for the beautiful forest to recover, Satoshi and his friends continue their journey.

20:15.920 --> 20:20.840
Pokémon no Uchi Atsumaru?

20:15.920 --> 20:20.840
Sunday February 21st at 8am!

20:16.430 --> 20:17.520
I'm Nicolegon!

20:18.080 --> 20:20.060
Nicole Fujita does Pokémon cosplay!

