21:20.090 --> 21:21.180
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.320 --> 21:23.830
At the Frey Tripokalon Tournament,

21:24.520 --> 21:27.610
a tough opponent named Amelia-san is standing in the way of my third Key.

21:28.590 --> 21:30.180
